name><surname>Taganov</surname><given-names>KD</given-names></name><name><surname>Boldin</surname><given-names>MP</given-names></name><name><surname>Chang</surname><given-names>KJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Baltimore</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>NF-kappaB-dependent induction of microRNA miR-146, an inhibitor targeted to signaling proteins of innate immune responses</article-title><source>Proc Natl Acad Sci USA</source><year>2006</year><volume>103</volume><fpage>12481</fpage><lpage>6</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16885212</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1073/pnas.0605298103</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B15"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Cahill</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Smyth</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Finn</surname><given-names>SP</given-names></name><name><surname>Denning</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Flavin</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>O'Regan</surname><given-names>EM</given-names></name><name><surname>Li</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Potratz</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Guenther</surname><given-names>SM</given-names></name><name><surname>Henfrey</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>O'Leary</surname><given-names>JJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Sheils</surname><given-names>O</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Effect of ret/PTC 1 rearrangement on transcription and post-transcriptional regulation in a papillary thyroid carcinoma model</article-title><source>Mol Cancer</source><year>2006</year><volume>5</volume><fpage>70</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17156473</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1186/1476-4598-5-70</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B16"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type=